WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.740
A picture hangs on a squared wall.

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:06.420
Behind it, out of sight, is a single nail.

3
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:11.170
Someone knocks it, and the whole picture
spins a quarter-turn clockwise round

4
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.460
that nail.

5
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.980
Here's the before and the after.

6
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.950
The nail is still covered.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.890
So where is the nail?

8
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:19.960
At a corner?

9
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.390
Halfway between the old and new positions?

10
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.810
Somewhere else?

11
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.740
In this mission, you'll
describe a rotation fully,

12
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:31.480
with three facts: its centre,
its angle and its direction.

13
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:35.020
You'll follow a point as it swings
along an arc round a centre,

14
00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.180
keeping its distance all the way.

15
00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.860
And you'll test a guess
with tracing paper.

16
00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:43.880
Pin it, turn it, and see if
the shape lands on its image.

17
00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:46.680
Your mission: find where the nail is.
